    RELEASE->>RELEASE: Verify destination, version, and intended audience
    RELEASE->>OPS: Associate release with monitoring and evidence
    OPS-->>TEAM: Report issues for investigation and follow-up
```

</MermaidZoom>

For a new app, complete governed enrollment before relying on its build routes. For an existing app, use its established setup and delivery configuration.

